# Generated data
# NOTE: use data/* (not data/) so git walks into the dir and per-child exceptions work.
data/*
# Exception: olympiad section data files are tracked (small, hand-curated).
!data/olympiads/
!data/olympiads/**
# Exception: olympiads_db.py — extracted data dict used by olympiad Blueprint.
!data/olympiads_db.py
# Exception: adaptive bank seed (9120 калиброванных задач L1..L8).
# Используется services/adaptive_full_seed.py при ADAPTIVE_FORCE_IMPORT=1.
!data/adaptive/
!data/adaptive/**
# Exception: figure-generation prompts are small hand-curated text files and are
# REQUIRED at runtime (routes/figures_generator.py, services/solution_generator.py).
!data/figures/
!data/figures/*.txt
